<h2>Microsoft 365 SMTP test</h2>
<p>This sends one test email to the signed-in administrator's own primary email address. It does not read incoming mail or create a ticket.</p>
<p>Save the plugin configuration and enable it before testing. Microsoft accepting SMTP submission does not guarantee inbox delivery.</p>
<%= form_tag microsoft365_smtp_test_path, method: :post do %>
  <%= submit_tag 'Send one test email to me', data: { confirm: 'Send one Microsoft 365 SMTP test email to your own administrator mailbox?' } %>
<% end %>
<p><%= link_to 'Plugin settings', plugin_settings_path('redmine_microsoft365_smtp') %></p>
